{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements.\n\nThe user's interest is: 摄影学习 (photography learning), focusing on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions. Explicitly NOT interested in equipment promotions (器材促销) or photographers' private lives (摄影师私生活).\n\nThe task requires selecting exactly 20 distinct candidates from the working set.\n\nLet me analyze the candidates. The candidates have titles with patterns like:\n- \"主题：场景中的内容类型\"\n\nContent types visible in descriptions:\n1. **市场观察** (market observation) - summarizes camera purchase packages, channel promotions, celebrity endorsements - this matches \"器材促销\" which the user explicitly does NOT want.\n2. **专题观察** (special topic observation) - records photography exhibition curation, author biography, artwork history - this matches \"摄影师私生活\" territory (author biography) and art activity history, which the user doesn't want.\n3. **条件与原理** (conditions and principles) - explains from light, imaging, visual relationships - this matches the user's interest in 成像原理 (imaging principles) and 不同条件下的调整 (adjustments under different conditions).\n4. **操作记录** (operation records) - fixes composition and light, changes parameters, records images - this matches 实际拍摄方法 (actual shooting methods).\n5. **概念速览** (concept overview) - lists common concepts - this is learning-oriented.\n\nSo the user's interest explicitly says: 关注实际拍摄方法、成像原理与不同条件下的调整 (focus on actual shooting methods, imaging principles, and adjustments under different conditions), 不关注器材促销或摄影师私生活 (not interested in equipment promotions or photographer private lives).\n\nTherefore:\n- **市场观察** candidates = equipment promotions → EXCLUDE\n- **专题观察** candidates = exhibition curation, author biography, artwork history → these relate to photographer private lives / art history → EXCLUDE (not aligned with learning shooting methods)\n- **条件与原理** candidates = imaging principles and conditions → INCLUDE\n- **操作记录** candidates = actual shooting methods → INCLUDE\n- **概念速览** candidates = concept overviews → INCLUDE (learning-oriented)\n\nLet me count the candidates that match the user's interest (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览).\n\nLet me identify all candidates and their content types.\n\nLet me go through the list. I need to select 20. Let me categorize each candidate by its content type based on the description.\n\nLet me list candidates with their content type:\n\n1. item-014950ee574d - 静物布光 低照度室内 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n2. item-03a565217024 - 运动追焦 窗边自然光 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n3. item-03b7af37b88f - 逆光人像 黄昏户外 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n4. item-04f2ff24ab7e - 雨天反光 窗边自然光 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n5. item-061d97575247 - 夜景曝光 阴天街道 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n6. item-064ccfdc15e3 - 室内白平衡 窗边自然光 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n7. item-07bfbf16235d - 微距景深 低照度室内 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n8. item-090691086c5b - 夜景曝光 低照度室内 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n9. item-09e96ac6aea0 - 微距景深 黄昏户外 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n10. item-0a19145321ef - 街头构图 窗边自然光 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n11. item-0b78ff27e538 - 微距景深 阴天街道 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n12. item-0ca34ef0a880 - 夜景曝光 阴天街道 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n13. item-10d5a61a7f0a - 雨天反光 窗边自然光 操作记录 → INCLUDE\n14. item-11c4e3cb9cf2 - 街头构图 黄昏户外 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n15. item-11d6f8fe3226 - 街头构图 低照度室内 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n16. item-12a571ccfc9e - 逆光人像 阴天街道 操作记录 → INCLUDE\n17. item-143c3c5732d6 - 室内白平衡 窗边自然光 市场观察 → EXCLUDE\n18. item-16a7440356e6 - 静物布光 窗边自然光 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n19. item-1a2494e4589c - 逆光人像 阴天街道 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n20. item-1b824b8d4dec - 风光滤镜 低照度室内 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n21. item-1b9b39a7ef86 - 儿童抓拍 阴天街道 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n22. item-2044482a2166 - 雨天反光 黄昏户外 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n23. item-2130f01f2f2c - 风光滤镜 低照度室内 条件与原理 → INCLUDE\n24. item-224628e85f98 - 逆光人像 阴天街道 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n25. item-225af9fad31a - 室内白平衡 阴天街道 操作记录 → INCLUDE\n26. item-2272238187d9 - 静物布光 阴天街道 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n27. item-23de96f8a693 - 夜景曝光 窗边自然光 专题观察 → EXCLUDE\n28. item-24351a134f2a - 街头构图 阴天街道 概念速览 → INCLUDE\n29. item-2589e00e0e34 - 微距景深 低照度室内 操作记录 → INCLUDE\n30. item-258cf26f5a90 - 静物布光 低